      "reason": "Read directly by scripts/select_pilot_cluster.py (path built from Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent, i.e. THIS repo's own root) to validate concept specs during pilot-cluster ranking. The only vendor/ file any scripts/*.py actually opens at runtime -- everything else under vendor/ is copied-not-imported logic or prose reference. #57 must replace this Path(__file__)-relative lookup with a packaged-resource abstraction before a distributed binary can run outside a ligature-workspace checkout; #57's own issue text names this exact gap."
