      "pattern": "vendor/concept-to-code/__pycache__/",
      "reason": "Bytecode cache inside the vendored submodule checkout."
    },
    {
      "pattern": "any project-descriptor.json / policy doc / .env / credential file a target repository authors after `ligature init`",
      "reason": "User-owned content belonging to a CONSUMER of this pipeline, never to ligature-workspace's own release artifact -- the #58 ownership-manifest split (owned vs. user-owned) applies here even though #58 itself is out of scope for #55."
